From 9365fff7b5087ee72919be3ef0133e5f4f163a29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shelley Vohr <shelley.vohr@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 13:04:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: sort the ICU source lists

configure.py lists the ICU source files in the order os.walk() returns
them, which depends on the file system. That order ends up in
icu_config.gypi and in the generated build files, so it differs between
machines.

PR-URL: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/67206
(Backported to v24.18.0 for solnix: same one-line change, this tree's line numbers.)
---
--- a/configure.py
+++ b/configure.py
@@ -2108,7 +2108,7 @@
             info(f'Using floating patch "{patchfile}" from "{dir_base}"')
         file_list.append(srcfile)
     break
-  return file_list
+  return sorted(file_list)
 
 def configure_intl(o):
   def icu_download(path):
